1
00:00:00,676 --> 00:00:03,556
Hey, Penny. Dumb-ass.

2
00:00:05,222 --> 00:00:06,932
(Leonard:)Leslie Winkle.

3
00:00:07,099 --> 00:00:10,189
(Sheldon:)Of all the overrated physicists
in all the labs in all the world...

4
00:00:10,352 --> 00:00:13,352
(Sheldon:)...why does it have to be Leslie Winkle?

5
00:00:13,522 --> 00:00:16,862
(Penny:)Well, they have a lot in common.
I mean, they're both scientists.

6
00:00:17,026 --> 00:00:19,946
(Sheldon:)Please. The only way she could make
a contribution to science...

7
00:00:20,112 --> 00:00:22,862
...would be if they resumed sending chimps
into space.

8
00:00:24,199 --> 00:00:26,869
(Penny:)Okay, well, I have a date too,
so I'll see you.

9
00:00:29,371 --> 00:00:31,661
(Sheldon:)Everybody has a date.

10
00:00:31,832 --> 00:00:36,212
(Sheldon:)Even you, Mario,
going after Princess Peach.

11
00:00:36,629 --> 00:00:39,799
And what am I doing?
I'm just enabling you.

12
00:00:44,219 --> 00:00:47,059
- This is pretty good orange chicken.
- Yeah, it's from Chang's.

13
00:00:47,222 --> 00:00:48,392
- Not Chow's?
- No, Chang's.

14
00:00:48,557 --> 00:00:51,097
- What happened to Chow's?
- It changed.

15
00:00:53,646 --> 00:00:56,226
(Leslie:)So how many children
do you think we should have?

16
00:00:56,398 --> 00:00:57,778
[COUGHING]

17
00:00:58,609 --> 00:01:01,649
(Leslie:)I'm sorry, that was a little abrupt.

